  legalFrameworkIntro: 'CRITICAL: Homeschool is ILLEGAL in Germany for German citizen children under Schulpflicht (Article 7 Grundgesetz + Compulsory Education Act). Both the German Constitutional Court and the European Court of Human Rights have upheld this position. Physical attendance at state-recognised school is required for German citizen children ages 6-17. Smartious does NOT serve as homeschool alternative for German citizen children of compulsory school age. Smartious serves specific legally viable segments in Germany.',
